<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Allow shrinking?-->
  <VPE.AllowShrink>允许缩小吗？</VPE.AllowShrink>
  <!--EN: Allow psycast gizmos to be shrunken to half size when there are a lot of them.-->
  <VPE.AllowShrink.Desc>当 psycast 小玩意很多时，允许将其缩小到一半大小。</VPE.AllowShrink.Desc>
  <!--EN: Scale base psyfocus gain with stat points?-->
  <VPE.ChangeFocusGain>用统计点衡量基础精神焦点增益？</VPE.ChangeFocusGain>
  <!--EN: If enabled, then the base psyfocus gain before any foci can be increased by spending stat points.-->
  <VPE.ChangeFocusGain.Desc>如果启用，则可以通过花费统计点来增加任何焦点之前的基础精神焦点增益。</VPE.ChangeFocusGain.Desc>
  <!--EN: Maximum psycaster level-->
  <VPE.MaxLevel>最高精神施法者等级</VPE.MaxLevel>
  <!--EN: Mute Skipdoor Sound-->
  <VPE.MuteSkipdoor>静音跳门声音</VPE.MuteSkipdoor>
  <!--EN: Basilicus Bestower Psycaster strength factor-->
  <VPE.PsycasterSpawnAdditional>Basilicus Bestower Psycaster 强度系数</VPE.PsycasterSpawnAdditional>
  <!--EN: Basilicus Bestower Psycaster spawn chance-->
  <VPE.PsycasterSpawnBaseChance>巴西利库斯赐予者灵能施法者的生成几率</VPE.PsycasterSpawnBaseChance>
  <!--EN: UI small mode-->
  <VPE.SmallMode>UI小模式</VPE.SmallMode>
  <!--EN: In small mode, the stats are moved to a tooltip and the psysets are moved to a separate dialog. If checked, this will force small mode. If X'ed, this will ban small mode. If partial (yellow line), this will allow default behavior (small mode will be active if your vertical resolution is less than 1080).-->
  <VPE.SmallMode.Desc>在小模式下，统计数据被移动到工具提示，而 psysets 被移动到单独的对话框。如果选中，这将强制使用小模式。如果 X'ed，这将禁止小模式。如果是部分（黄线），这将允许默认行为（如果垂直分辨率小于 1080，小模式将处于活动状态）。</VPE.SmallMode.Desc>
  <!--EN: Psycaster XP per Psyfocus % gained-->
  <VPE.XPPerPercent>Psycaster XP 每 Psyfocus % 获得</VPE.XPPerPercent>
  <!--EN: Vanilla Psycasts Expanded-->
  <VanillaPsycastsExpanded>香草心理广播扩展</VanillaPsycastsExpanded>
</LanguageData>
